From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 05:08:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] mobile: add EZOFIS V6 mobile app (React + Vite + Capacitor
 7), v0.4.4

- Sign-in with loggedFrom MOBILE, 2FA, org switch
- Workflow API: all-workflows inbox, per-workflow request tabs (requestTabs / by-activity),
  ticket detail (form, files, chat, history), move-next with workflow button colours
- New request with web-form parity (defaults, master data, cascades, formulas, OCR fill, 20 MB uploads)
- In-app file viewer (PDF, images, eml/msg, Word, Excel, PowerPoint) with metadata and AI summary
- Auto-refresh and phone notifications (Capacitor LocalNotifications)
- apk-shell: SDK-free test APK builder (signing key generated locally, git-ignored)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
